le_name": "ScreenShot04.png", "id": "2204709590924904", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839664_2204709597591570_6933420588525696365_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BFZxk1EBc9oQ7kNvwHvdTQ3&_nc_oc=AdrY5CpinkqgRg-GlL2jJeX51pLXT1qiKpiPg8BZXmUncnAruvaqUUCxzM_ntje5BL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRSMRfnpBU0Rr3e8V0AsYS0krqb_uLs3I8pSftqXQVN5w&oe=6B0B1CEC"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot05.png", "id": "1139686721767694", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908887017_1139686725101027_3163724573995209892_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=08bx3NiYA18Q7kNvwGchEJT&_nc_oc=AdqJtW2aR51MGmyMcjys4Xr9RvV_MLGsU8GOlWzkXzeGnbwosiYQB2kDBwxsyVpqoiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ75n0FIZWjaHsa8xhkwwaEvVc8XBYP58ofyu9pS5gzMA&oe=6B0B29E5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "1123453383754064", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623185_1123453387087397_4764396718904800406_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PxKYv2wS5ioQ7kNvwHSOc-F&_nc_oc=AdqKpf_JssVinVCgMzaS0jllUDjIfPLwtUFysB37W4EbqDbRym9M5weeCVw_DwrnRnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSlX6YTKQZtufUNm7n_oCvx5Ro1xzWjhzLpDtHS51qPWw&oe=6B0B2CDF"}, "display_name": "Is That a Chicken?", "keywords": ["chicken", "egg", "hatch", "cooking", "food"], "long_description": "\u258e**Is That a Chicken?**\n-\nChicken Alchemy Sandbox!\nRun a shop and collect mutant chickens. cock-a-doodle-do, cluck, cluck!\n\n\ud83d\udcac **Join Our Discord**\n-\nhttps://discord.gg/Z9EuAJhKJB\n-                                                                                                         \n{1429651441929486}\n\n---\n\u258e**\ud83d\udc23 The Hatch Reveal**\n\nWait for the big reveal!\n-\nWill you hatch a familiar chicken or discover something completely new? You never know what's coming out next!\n-\n{1476213021038554}\n\n---\n\u258e**\ud83d\udc14 All Kinds of Chickens**\n\nA fire chicken that's literally on fire, a disco chicken with cool sunglasses \u2014 collect the bizarre mutants born from cosmic radiation. Every strange interaction might create a brand-new chicken, so experimentation is half the fun.\n-\n{1554396536450780}\n\n---\n\u258e**\ud83d\udece\ufe0f Orders Up!**\n\nEggs, chickens, burgers, and cooked meals\u2014your customers want it all! Take their orders, prepare what they need, and keep the customers coming!\n-\n{1422129766754802}\n\n---\n\u258e**\ud83d\udd2b Vacuum! Shot!**\n\nThe EggGun helps you handle eggs.\n-\n{2635385546915667}\n\n\n---\n\u258e**\ud83d\udca6 Clean Up the Chaos!**\n\nSplash eggs, make a mess, and grab the Washer Gun to wash it all away! From messy floors to splattered walls, every corner is yours to clean!\n-\n{1154807963556590}\n---\n\n", "short_description": "Hatch and collect mutant creatures\nIs That a Chicken? is a single-player VR creature collector set on a space farm. Between customer orders, try different feeds and tools to discover what hatches next. Each new mutant gets its own entry in your Chicken-dex."}]}, "developer_name": "ImmersedPlayer", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immersedplayer.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmersedPlayer", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immersedplayer.com/games/is-that-a-chicken", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, 